# public/build is committed on purpose. The production host has no outbound
# network, so `vite build` there fails fetching webfonts; Node exists only in
# root's nvm; and npm ci is broken by a macOS-generated lock file. Shipping the
# built assets makes a deploy `git pull` and nothing else. See DEPLOYMENT.md.
